      "value": "Yeah many of the visemes of my avatars are broken and dont blink or talk... LOCALLY. But apparently work just fine for everyone else when it was confirmed they all worked before. Whats weirder is that 4 avatars I did all from the same model maker, using the same process, in the same SDK, to the same account, is that 1 of the 4 avatars visemes work just fine. I havnt the foggiest idea why.",
